1
00:00:03,139 --> 00:00:08,722
Getting started. Sign up, sign in and the onboarding wizard

2
00:00:09,245 --> 00:00:14,015
To sign in, enter your email and password, then click Sign In.

3
00:00:14,127 --> 00:00:17,318
New to GoalNexa? Click Sign up.

4
00:00:17,431 --> 00:00:23,873
Enter your name, your email and a password of at least eight characters. Then click Sign Up.

5
00:00:24,969 --> 00:00:29,913
If your administrator asks for confirmed addresses, open the link we email you.

6
00:00:30,012 --> 00:00:36,407
Forgot your password? Click Forgot password, and we'll email you a link that works for two hours.

7
00:00:37,821 --> 00:00:43,705
The first time you sign in, with no goals yet, a short wizard helps you set up.

8
00:00:46,790 --> 00:00:52,628
First, choose how you'll use GoalNexa. Let's pick Use the website.

9
00:00:52,737 --> 00:00:59,469
Name your organization: your team, company or household. Then click Next.

10
00:00:59,563 --> 00:01:05,146
Type a goal, and optionally a target date, so GoalNexa can predict whether you'll make it.

11
00:01:05,261 --> 00:01:10,542
Add a metric for each goal: one number with a start and a target.

12
00:01:11,328 --> 00:01:17,851
Check the summary, and click Create and open dashboard. Nothing is saved before this step.

13
00:01:19,805 --> 00:01:28,290
Prefer chatting? Use an AI agent connects Claude, ChatGPT and others, and your assistant sets everything up.

14
00:01:28,394 --> 00:01:31,933
Skip for now opens an empty dashboard instead.
